    {
      "text": "从10类200多种基因构筑协同效果，但强化越多越容易触发恶性基因惩罚",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose from over 200 powerful genes in 10 different categories and upgrade according to your preferences. Unlock powerful synergistic effects by gathering various types of enhancement genes. Watch out for malicious genes, a key element in this Roguelite that thrives on the blend of luck and skill. As you equip more enhancement genes, your chances of manifesting a malicious gene will increase. Be wary as you'll sustain harsh penalties if you fail to meet the requirements.",
